---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { firm } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Disclaimer for the website of Anveshana Advocates & Consultants, published in accordance with the rules of the Bar Council of India."
  eyebrow="Legal"
  lines={['Disclaimer']}
  lead="Published in accordance with the rules of the Bar Council of India."
  updated="August 2026"
>
  <h2>No advertisement or solicitation</h2>
  <p>
    The rules of the Bar Council of India prohibit advocates from advertising
    or soliciting work in any form or manner. This website is not intended to
    be, and does not constitute, an advertisement, solicitation, invitation or
    inducement of any kind.
  </p>
  <p>
    By accessing this website, the user acknowledges and confirms of their own
    accord that:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      There has been no advertisement, personal communication, solicitation,
      invitation or inducement of any sort whatsoever from {firm.legalName}
      or any of its members to solicit work through this website;
    </li>
    <li>
      The user wishes to gain more information about the firm for their own
      information and use;
    </li>
    <li>
      All information contained on this website is provided only on the
      user's specific request, and any material downloaded from it is entirely
      at the user's own volition; and
    </li>
    <li>
      Any transmission, receipt or use of this website will not create, and
      does not constitute, an advocate–client relationship.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Not legal advice</h2>
  <p>
    Nothing on this website is, or should be construed as, legal advice or a
    legal opinion on any specific facts or circumstances. The content is
    general in nature and may not reflect the most current legal position.
    Law, procedure and limitation periods change, and their application varies
    with the facts of each matter.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>
      You should not act, or refrain from acting, on the basis of anything
      contained on this website without seeking independent legal advice on
      your own circumstances.
    </strong>
    The firm accepts no liability for any consequence of any action taken by a
    user relying on material or information published here.
  </p>

  <h2>No advocate–client relationship</h2>
  <p>
    Contacting the firm through this website, by email, or by telephone does
    not by itself create an advocate–client relationship. Such a relationship
    arises only when the firm has confirmed in writing that it is able to act
    for you, after the necessary conflict checks have been completed and the
    terms of engagement have been agreed.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please do not send confidential or privileged information to the firm
    until an engagement has been confirmed. Information sent before that point
    may not be treated as confidential and may not be protected by privilege.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party links</h2>
  <p>
    This website may contain links to external websites, including mapping
    services. The firm is not responsible for the content, accuracy or privacy
    practices of any external website, and a link should not be taken as an
    endorsement.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any question about this disclaimer, please write to
    <a href={`mailto:${firm.email}`}>{firm.email}</a> or call
    <a href={`tel:${firm.phoneHref}`}>{firm.phone}</a>.
  </p>
</Legal>
